{
  "narrator\nMabli heard a little buzz in the meadow. Some bees needed her help.": "audio/narration/narrator-b38da4303abd.wav",
  "bee\nBzz! Can you make us golden again? Tap each bee.": "audio/narration/bee-cea3f040551a.wav",
  "bee\nBzz-bzz! My friends need gold too!": "audio/narration/bee-e721d5cd13a1.wav",
  "bee\nThank you, Mabli! Now our meadow is buzzing with colour!": "audio/narration/bee-3769960bf85e.wav",
  "narrator\nEvening came, and Mabli found a glade full of little fireflies.": "audio/narration/narrator-bb83a6c7bef5.wav",
  "firefly\nOur little lights have gone out. Tap each firefly to help us glow.": "audio/narration/firefly-a058a786b8c4.wav",
  "firefly\nA little light! Help the other fireflies too.": "audio/narration/firefly-8f1c96af2f32.wav",
  "firefly\nThank you, Mabli! Follow our lights to the rainbow hill.": "audio/narration/firefly-72e308e91090.wav",
  "narrator\nAfter the rain, three little snails peeked out of the leaves.": "audio/narration/narrator-6770a166c0f9.wav",
  "snail\nHello, Mabli. Will you colour our little shells? Tap each snail.": "audio/narration/snail-32bdfd00e156.wav",
  "snail\nLovely! There are more little shells to colour.": "audio/narration/snail-58e585ba693f.wav",
  "snail\nLook at our pretty shells! Thank you, Mabli. Let's go slowly, together.": "audio/narration/snail-ec2a61130b06.wav",
  "narrator\nMabli found four little ducklings beside the stream.": "audio/narration/narrator-cf046c53ac10.wav",
  "duckling\nQuack! Our yellow feathers are gone. Tap each duckling to help!": "audio/narration/duckling-76928312dee7.wav",
  "duckling\nQuack, quack! Help my friends too!": "audio/narration/duckling-c5b4c1f293e9.wav",
  "duckling\nWe're fluffy and yellow again! Thank you, Mabli!": "audio/narration/duckling-a8e2381b8df4.wav",
  "narrator\nOnce, all the colour drained out of the world — every last drop.": "audio/narration/narrator-0234db3f65f6.wav",
  "narrator\nOnly one thing kept its colour: the rainbow hair of a little girl named Mabli.": "audio/narration/narrator-abfef2c349c2.wav",
  "narrator\nMabli found some flowers, but they have no colour. Tap each flower to colour it in!": "audio/narration/narrator-80225fe0298e.wav",
  "mabli\nSo pretty! Let's colour the other flowers too!": "audio/narration/mabli-c674d0b7266a.wav",
  "mabli\nWe did it! Look at all those lovely colours. Come on, let's see who's waiting for us!": "audio/narration/mabli-3fc394eea88e.wav",
  "narrator\nMabli followed the path to a quiet, grey pond…": "audio/narration/narrator-7b03534fb202.wav",
  "frog\n“Ribbit! I lost my green. Can you tap me and make me green again?”": "audio/narration/frog-f794174775fc.wav",
  "frog\n“Ribbit-ribbit! I'm green again! Thank you, Mabli!”": "audio/narration/frog-a7a98d0a8259.wav",
  "narrator\nThe path opened into a dull, grey meadow…": "audio/narration/narrator-d95bd3b88f4b.wav",
  "butterfly\nHello, little friend! Our wings have lost their colours. Will you tap each butterfly and help us shine?": "audio/narration/butterfly-51293f5b37b2.wav",
  "butterfly\nOoh, lovely! My friends would like colourful wings too!": "audio/narration/butterfly-cbaf6385b829.wav",
  "butterfly\nThank you! Our wings are bright again. Let's dance across the meadow!": "audio/narration/butterfly-3e3998b6e261.wav",
  "narrator\nBeyond the meadow stood a great, grey apple tree…": "audio/narration/narrator-0eb568f66548.wav",
  "narrator\nThe apples have no colour! Tap each apple to fill it with colour.": "audio/narration/narrator-6417e552175b.wav",
  "narrator\nYum! Colour the rest too!": "audio/narration/narrator-0b06263ba494.wav",
  "narrator\nYou did it! The orchard is ripe with colour!": "audio/narration/narrator-957ea96c5956.wav",
  "narrator\nIn a hush of grey trees, someone was waiting…": "audio/narration/narrator-1e32f953bc5b.wav",
  "fox\n“Hello! My orange coat is gone. Tap me to bring it back!”": "audio/narration/fox-07554c243bb6.wav",
  "fox\n“Oh, my orange coat! Thank you, Mabli!”": "audio/narration/fox-ffaaac34ade9.wav",
  "narrator\nAt last Mabli climbed a hill beneath a wide, grey sky…": "audio/narration/narrator-3455b3a2b34c.wav",
  "narrator\nThe End. And so Mabli, the girl with the rainbow hair, brought colour back to the whole world.": "audio/narration/narrator-f352c455a4ca.wav",
  "narrator\nThe whole sky is grey! Tap the sun and each cloud to colour them.": "audio/narration/narrator-da42f67a61db.wav",
  "narrator\nBeautiful! Keep colouring the sky!": "audio/narration/narrator-77bf26c742ac.wav",
  "narrator\nColour rushed back into every corner of the world!": "audio/narration/narrator-4d1aba668058.wav",
  "narrator\nA little song drifted across the still, grey meadow…": "audio/narration/narrator-2055116887bd.wav",
  "bird\n“Tweet! Our feathers need some blue. Can you tap each little bird?”": "audio/narration/bird-9b9c97f69026.wav",
  "bird\n“Tweet-tweet! Help my friends too!”": "audio/narration/bird-1ac5e4df2350.wav",
  "bird\n“We can sing in colour again! Thank you, Mabli!”": "audio/narration/bird-638db6020adb.wav",
  "narrator\nSomething soft rustled in the tall, grey grass…": "audio/narration/narrator-1fe60e3a8c19.wav",
  "rabbit\n“Hello, Mabli. Can you make my soft fur brown again? Tap me!”": "audio/narration/rabbit-309d813db624.wav",
  "rabbit\n“My fur feels warm again. Thank you, Mabli!”": "audio/narration/rabbit-c5cf1e2876ba.wav",
  "narrator\nDeeper in, a little ring of toadstools stood waiting…": "audio/narration/narrator-8ecaa452c3ce.wav",
  "narrator\nThe toadstools have lost their cheerful red caps. Tap each one to colour it in!": "audio/narration/narrator-10f31b608758.wav",
  "narrator\nLovely and red! Colour the others too.": "audio/narration/narrator-2d3490151af8.wav",
  "narrator\nA whole ring of red toadstools — wonderful!": "audio/narration/narrator-5088cf164244.wav",
  "narrator\nOne.": "audio/narration/narrator-8dfb9d3d35ad.wav",
  "narrator\nTwo.": "audio/narration/narrator-68c9d02ffe5c.wav",
  "narrator\nThree.": "audio/narration/narrator-2933f1af9082.wav",
  "narrator\nFour.": "audio/narration/narrator-205147bf55db.wav",
  "narrator\nFive.": "audio/narration/narrator-18a46b494cd0.wav",
  "narrator\nSix.": "audio/narration/narrator-3f523497a625.wav",
  "narrator\nSeven.": "audio/narration/narrator-87dd1c7e9ad8.wav",
  "narrator\nEight.": "audio/narration/narrator-c0b3dfcaebb1.wav",
  "narrator\nNine.": "audio/narration/narrator-3c5f3aa02609.wav",
  "narrator\nTen.": "audio/narration/narrator-e8e9cc6623e0.wav"
}
